Subject: [PATCH] cps2w: scaffold the CPS-2 WIDE core as a separate core
 (Vampire Saved)

cfg/ is a twin of cores/cps2/cfg with CORENAME=JTCPS2W and the MRA set
restricted to the vsav family (the stock reference leg). No RTL change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LSnD4L6RQVEF4JmX3CtE7N
